{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1602","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"B. Divine Array"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"2 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"256 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Black is gifted with a Divine array $$$a$$$ consisting of $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 2000$$$) integers. Each position in $$$a$$$ has an initial value. After shouting a curse over the array, it becomes angry and starts an unstoppable transformation."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The transformation consists of infinite steps. Array $$$a$$$ changes at the $$$i$$$-th step in the following way: for every position $$$j$$$, $$$a_j$$$ becomes equal to the number of occurrences of $$$a_j$$$ in $$$a$$$ before starting this step."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Here is an example to help you understand the process better: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initial array:"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$2$$$ $$$1$$$ $$$1$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$1$$$ $$$2$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After the $$$1$$$-st step:"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$2$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$1$$$ $$$1$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$2$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After the $$$2$$$-nd step:"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$2$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$2$$$ $$$2$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$2$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After the $$$3$$$-rd step:"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$4$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$4$$$ $$$3$$$ $$$4$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"..."}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"..."}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"}],"kind":"table_body"}],"kind":"table"}],"kind":"container"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the initial array, we had two $$$2$$$-s, three $$$1$$$-s, only one $$$4$$$ and only one $$$3$$$, so after the first step, each element became equal to the number of its occurrences in the initial array: all twos changed to $$$2$$$, all ones changed to $$$3$$$, four changed to $$$1$$$ and three changed to $$$1$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The transformation steps continue "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"forever"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"You have to process $$$q$$$ queries: in each query, Black is curious to know the value of $$$a_x$$$ after the $$$k$$$-th step of transformation."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Each test contains multiple test cases. The first line contains the number of test cases $$$t$$$ ($$$1 \\le t \\le 1000$$$). Description of the test cases follows."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line of each test case contains an integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 2000$$$) — the size of the array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The second line of each test case contains $$$n$$$ integers $$$a_1, a_2, \\dots, a_n$$$ ($$$1 \\le a_i \\le n$$$) — the initial values of array $$$a$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The third line of each test case contains a single integer $$$q$$$ ($$$1 \\le q \\le 100\\,000$$$) — the number of queries."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Next $$$q$$$ lines contain the information about queries — one query per line. The $$$i$$$-th line contains two integers $$$x_i$$$ and $$$k_i$$$ ($$$1 \\le x_i \\le n$$$; $$$0 \\le k_i \\le 10^9$$$), meaning that Black is asking for the value of $$$a_{x_i}$$$ after the $$$k_i$$$-th step of transformation. $$$k_i = 0$$$ means that Black is interested in values of the initial array."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the sum of $$$n$$$ over all test cases doesn't exceed $$$2000$$$ and the sum of $$$q$$$ over all test cases doesn't exceed $$$100\\,000$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For each test case, print $$$q$$$ answers. The $$$i$$$-th of them should be the value of $$$a_{x_i}$$$ after the $$$k_i$$$-th step of transformation. It can be shown that the answer to each query is unique."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n2\n7\n2 1 1 4 3 1 2\n4\n3 0\n1 1\n2 2\n6 1\n2\n1 1\n2\n1 0\n2 1000000000\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n1\n2\n3\n3\n1\n2\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first test case was described ih the statement. It can be seen that: "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":true},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k_1 = 0$$$ (initial array): $$$a_3 = 1$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k_2 = 1$$$ (after the $$$1$$$-st step): $$$a_1 = 2$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k_3 = 2$$$ (after the $$$2$$$-nd step): $$$a_2 = 3$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" $$$k_4 = 1$$$ (after the $$$1$$$-st step): $$$a_6 = 3$$$. "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For the second test case, "}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Initial array:"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$1$$$ $$$1$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After the $$$1$$$-st step:"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$2$$$ $$$2$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"After the $$$2$$$-nd step:"}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"$$$2$$$ $$$2$$$"}],"kind":"table_cell"}],"kind":"table_row"},{"children":[{"attrs":{"header":false},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"..."}],"kind":"table_cell"},{"attrs":{"hea